For the unbalanced reaction below, calculate $\mathcal{E}^{\circ}$ and indicate whether the reaction is spontaneous under standard conditions. Balance the reaction. Use $\mathcal{E}^{\circ}(\ce{HMnO_4^-}/\ce{MnO_2}) =$1.70V and $\mathcal{E}^{\circ}(\ce{Fe2O3}/\ce{Fe^{2+}}) =$0.728V
 \begin{center}\ce{	MnO_2	 + Fe2O3_{(s)}   	 <=>	Fe^{2+} +      HMnO_4^- 	}     \end{center}
